ative&quot;},&quot;y&quot;:{&quot;field&quot;:&quot;new_works&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;quantitative&quot;}}},{&quot;data&quot;:{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;./@file/2602-20088-jSq6lT44.arrow&quot;,&quot;format&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;arrow&quot;}},&quot;mark&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;bar&quot;,&quot;color&quot;:&quot;#ff6b6b&quot;},&quot;encoding&quot;:{&quot;tooltip&quot;:[{&quot;field&quot;:&quot;year&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;quantitative&quot;},{&quot;field&quot;:&quot;new_works&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;quantitative&quot;},{&quot;field&quot;:&quot;cumulative&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;quantitative&quot;}],&quot;x&quot;:{&quot;field&quot;:&quot;year&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;quantitative&quot;},&quot;y&quot;:{&quot;field&quot;:&quot;new_works&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;quantitative&quot;}}},{&quot;data&quot;:{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;./@file/2666-20088-E8ehPg7U.arrow&quot;,&quot;format&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;arrow&quot;}},&quot;mark&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;bar&quot;,&quot;color&quot;:&quot;#e07b39&quot;,&quot;opacity&quot;:0.7},&quot;encoding&quot;:{&quot;tooltip&quot;:[{&quot;field&quot;:&quot;year&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;quantitative&quot;},{&quot;field&quot;:&quot;new_works&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;quantitative&quot;},{&quot;field&quot;:&quot;cumulative&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;quantitative&quot;}],&quot;x&quot;:{&quot;field&quot;:&quot;year&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;quantitative&quot;},&quot;y&quot;:{&quot;field&quot;:&quot;new_works&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;quantitative&quot;}}}],&quot;height&quot;:400,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Annual New Works Influenced by Oceanus Folk (Burst-Driven Pattern)&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:600}],&quot;&#36;schema&quot;:&quot;https://vega.github.io/schema/vega-lite/v6.1.0.json&quot;}' data-chart-selection='true' data-field-selection='true' data-embed-options='{}'></marimo-vega></marimo-ui-element><marimo-callout-output data-html='&quot;&lt;span class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key finding:&lt;/strong&gt; Oceanus Folk&#x27;s influence follows an &lt;strong&gt;intermittent, burst-driven pattern&lt;/strong&gt; rather than a gradual rise.&lt;/span&gt;&#92;n&lt;h3 id=&#92;&quot;evidence-for-this-pattern&#92;&quot;&gt;Evidence for this Pattern:&lt;/h3&gt;&#92;n&lt;ul&gt;&#92;n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1980-2005:&lt;/strong&gt; Nearly horizontal cumulative curve with minimal annual activity&lt;/li&gt;&#92;n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Peak burst in 2023:&lt;/strong&gt; 25 works influenced in a single year\u2014the genre&#x27;s largest impact&lt;/li&gt;&#92;n&lt;li&gt;The cumulative curve shows clear step-like increases during burst years&lt;/li&gt;&#92;n&lt;li&gt;Other distinct bursts visible around 2010, 2017, and 2028&lt;/li&gt;&#92;n&lt;/ul&gt;&#92;n&lt;h3 id=&#92;&quot;conclusion&#92;&quot;&gt;Conclusion:&lt;/h3&gt;&#92;n&lt;span class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&gt;This pattern definitively rejects the hypothesis of a smooth or gradual rise. Instead, the genre&#x27;s &#92;nexpansion was triggered by specific cultural moments or influential releases, with the 2023 burst &#92;nrepresenting the maximum cross-genre impact\u2014occurring five years before Sailor Shift&#x27;s 2028 breakthrough.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&quot;' data-kind='&quot;info&quot;'></marimo-callout-output></div>"
