me&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;nominal&quot;},{&quot;field&quot;:&quot;main_genre&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;nominal&quot;},{&quot;field&quot;:&quot;total&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;quantitative&quot;}],&quot;x&quot;:{&quot;field&quot;:&quot;total&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Number of Influenced Works&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;quantitative&quot;},&quot;y&quot;:{&quot;field&quot;:&quot;name&quot;,&quot;sort&quot;:&quot;-x&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Artist&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;nominal&quot;}},&quot;height&quot;:280,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;view_a236c49a4f574520_1&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:400}]}]}],&quot;params&quot;:[{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;selector_task2_q2&quot;,&quot;select&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;point&quot;,&quot;fields&quot;:[&quot;genre_grouped&quot;]},&quot;views&quot;:[&quot;view_d55927e45a00c08e_0&quot;,&quot;view_89670a611f17211c_0&quot;,&quot;view_9b1457091320c00f_0&quot;,&quot;view_a236c49a4f574520_1&quot;]}],&quot;&#36;schema&quot;:&quot;https://vega.github.io/schema/vega-lite/v6.1.0.json&quot;}' data-chart-selection='false' data-field-selection='true' data-embed-options='{}'></marimo-vega></marimo-ui-element><marimo-callout-output data-html='&quot;&lt;span class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key finding:&lt;/strong&gt; Oceanus Folk&#x27;s influence is both &lt;strong&gt;deep and broad&lt;/strong&gt;, reaching beyond its home genre into diverse musical territories.&lt;/span&gt;&#92;n&lt;h3 id=&#92;&quot;most-influenced-genres&#92;&quot;&gt;Most Influenced Genres:&lt;/h3&gt;&#92;n&lt;ul&gt;&#92;n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Indie Folk (22 works):&lt;/strong&gt; The most heavily impacted specific genre, confirming Oceanus Folk as a foundational pillar within the modern folk movement&lt;/li&gt;&#92;n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Synthwave (17 works):&lt;/strong&gt; Significant influence in atmospheric and electronic-leaning styles, suggesting Oceanus Folk&#x27;s textures are highly compatible with modern production&lt;/li&gt;&#92;n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dream Pop (15 works):&lt;/strong&gt; Strong presence in ethereal, effects-driven styles&lt;/li&gt;&#92;n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&#92;&quot;Other&#92;&quot; category (24 works):&lt;/strong&gt; The largest total group, indicating a wide &#92;&quot;long-tail&#92;&quot; distribution across numerous niche sub-genres&lt;/li&gt;&#92;n&lt;/ul&gt;&#92;n&lt;h3 id=&#92;&quot;most-influenced-artists&#92;&quot;&gt;Most Influenced Artists:&lt;/h3&gt;&#92;n&lt;ul&gt;&#92;n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stephen Meyer (3 works):&lt;/strong&gt; The most influenced individual artist, with 3 distinct works directly attributed to Oceanus Folk&#x27;s influence&lt;/li&gt;&#92;n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dense secondary tier (2 works each):&lt;/strong&gt; Artists including Guiying Liao, Yan Zou, Tao Hu, and Jun Zhou demonstrate that influence is decentralized and widespread&lt;/li&gt;&#92;n&lt;/ul&gt;&#92;n&lt;h3 id=&#92;&quot;conclusion&#92;&quot;&gt;Conclusion:&lt;/h3&gt;&#92;n&lt;span class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&gt;The influence of Oceanus Folk is both deep (concentrated in Indie Folk) and broad (extending into Synthwave and Dream Pop). The widespread impact across a diverse range of artists proves that the genre has successfully transitioned from a niche style into a versatile source of inspiration for both mainstream and experimental creators.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&quot;' data-kind='&quot;info&quot;'></marimo-callout-output></div>"
