 dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key finding:&lt;/strong&gt; With Sailor Shift&#x27;s breakthrough, Oceanus Folk took a new direction\u2014away from its traditional roots and toward a modern, atmospheric style.&lt;/span&gt;&#92;n&lt;h3 id=&#92;&quot;the-disappearance-of-americana&#92;&quot;&gt;The Disappearance of Americana&lt;/h3&gt;&#92;n&lt;ul&gt;&#92;n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Before 2028:&lt;/strong&gt; Americana contributed &lt;strong&gt;10 influence edges&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#92;n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;After 2028:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;0 recorded influence&lt;/strong&gt; from Americana&lt;/li&gt;&#92;n&lt;/ul&gt;&#92;n&lt;h3 id=&#92;&quot;dream-pop-indie-folk-the-stable-pillars&#92;&quot;&gt;Dream Pop &amp;amp; Indie Folk: The Stable Pillars&lt;/h3&gt;&#92;n&lt;ul&gt;&#92;n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dream Pop:&lt;/strong&gt; Grew from 21 to &lt;strong&gt;29 total works&lt;/strong&gt; (added 8 after 2028)&lt;/li&gt;&#92;n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Indie Folk:&lt;/strong&gt; Grew from 20 to &lt;strong&gt;28 total works&lt;/strong&gt; (added 8 after 2028)&lt;/li&gt;&#92;n&lt;/ul&gt;&#92;n&lt;h3 id=&#92;&quot;emerging-textures-synthetic-cinematic&#92;&quot;&gt;Emerging Textures: Synthetic &amp;amp; Cinematic&lt;/h3&gt;&#92;n&lt;ul&gt;&#92;n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Synthwave&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Desert Rock&lt;/strong&gt; maintained steady influence after 2028&lt;/li&gt;&#92;n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Space Rock&lt;/strong&gt; showed consistent presence&lt;/li&gt;&#92;n&lt;/ul&gt;&#92;n&lt;h3 id=&#92;&quot;conclusion&#92;&quot;&gt;Conclusion:&lt;/h3&gt;&#92;n&lt;span class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&gt;After 2028, Oceanus Folk drew less from Americana and continued to rely on Dream Pop and Indie Folk. This shift in its own influences likely contributed to the stylistic evolution heard in works influenced by the genre during this period.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&quot;' data-kind='&quot;info&quot;'></marimo-callout-output></div>"
